# Title: File Download Via Nscurl - MacOS
# ID: 6d8a7cf1-8085-423b-b87d-7e880faabbdf
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Daniel Cortez
# Date: 2024-06-04
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
# Description: Detects the execution of the nscurl utility in order to download files.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(@Image:*/nscurl AND (@CommandLine:*--download * OR @CommandLine:*--download-directory * OR @CommandLine:*--output * OR @CommandLine:*-dir * OR @CommandLine:*-dl * OR @CommandLine:*-ld* OR @CommandLine:*-o *))
